Villmark species models
=======================

This package contains ONNX-converted copies of two models by other authors.
The weights are unchanged; the files have been converted from PyTorch to
ONNX and reduced in precision. See README.md for a full description of the
changes.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------
SpeciesNet  (speciesnet.onnx, speciesnet.labels.json)

  Copyright 2024 Google LLC

  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE.
  Source: https://github.com/google/cameratrapai
  Weights: https://www.kaggle.com/models/google/speciesnet (pyTorch/v4.0.3b)

  Changed: exported to ONNX opset 17 with a fixed batch size of 1, converted
  to fp16. The label list was rewritten from a text file to JSON, with the
  contents and the order unchanged.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------
birder resnet_v2_50_inat21  (inat21.onnx, inat21.labels.json)

  From the Birder project.

  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE.
  Source: https://huggingface.co/birder-project/resnet_v2_50_inat21
  Project: https://gitlab.com/birder/birder

  Changed: the 256px variant exported to ONNX opset 17 with a fixed batch
  size of 1, quantized to int8 (QDQ, per channel, percentile calibration).
  The class list was rewritten as JSON and extended with genus, family,
  order, class and phylum.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------
iNaturalist 2021  (the taxonomy in inat21.labels.json)

  The species names and the taxonomic ranks come from the category list of
  the iNat2021 competition.

  Source: https://github.com/visipedia/inat_comp/tree/master/2021

-------------------------------------------------------------------------
MegaDetector

  Not included. The SpeciesNet package from Kaggle contains MegaDetector
  v5a, but Villmark uses the whole-image classifier 4.0.3b, which needs no
  detector.
